{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>紀念孫中山先生誕辰160周年大會今（12日）上午在北京舉行。中共中央總書記、國家主席、中央軍委主席習近平出席大會並發表重要講話。中共中央政治局常委李強、趙樂際、王滬寧、蔡奇、丁薛祥、李希出席大會。（新華社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.633019+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:48:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:21.930850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:21.930850+00:00","content_hash":"25568e1f8fccfb18ec926d3d97dc61b9d60825f9b8ff2dde37954301f5646ead","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}